# DAP implicit state-machine inventory

Source: /Users/hughpyle/play/artroom at e50d9eebb27f47d0f33549486751ab8bdce8de80.
Audit date: 7 November 2026. Read-only source audit. No source changes, tests, or gate runs.

This inventory treats a state machine as implicit when legal next steps depend on flags, nullable fields, collections, retained records, or prior calls. Some machines expose phase labels but keep important substates across other fields. The names below describe inferred machines, not confirmed defects.

Coverage: live libraries, apps, examples, and tooling. Exclusions: dependencies, generated copies, historical notes, test fixtures, and ordinary accumulation loops. Rows group repeated implementations. Paths below resolve against the source checkout and commit above. This inventory does not claim formal proof of exhaustiveness.

