## Main finding

Uncertainty and completion differ. Across operations, publication, credentials, requests, and audio, apparent success or timeout alone does not determine whether work settled. Refactors must preserve that distinction, exact retained originals, durable marks before external effects, and ownership of late asynchronous results.

